{"2830090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sixth Force", "steam_appid": 2830090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4999260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the Sixth Force in a <strong>comedy co-op adventure for 2 players</strong> where connection becomes a superpower. You and your partner are linked by a  <strong>bond</strong> that keeps you close and powers your <strong>energy whips</strong>. The same force that binds you also gives you power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, it is all sugar, giggles, and cozy chaos. But beneath the frosting, something stranger is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/68d8628632e9523f8e078596df3d7071.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/68d8628632e9523f8e078596df3d7071.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/68d8628632e9523f8e078596df3d7071.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The bond connects you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bond keeps both players linked at all times. It lets you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drag each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >slide along rails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >levitate your partner <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/42ea641426aef39de7284cdf3e4684d3.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/42ea641426aef39de7284cdf3e4684d3.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/42ea641426aef39de7284cdf3e4684d3.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The energy whips give you reach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your energy whips are what that connection becomes when it reaches into the world. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grapple and swing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drag objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >freeze obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight ridiculous enemies <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b43b6289d6e9c12992763348336dd423.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b43b6289d6e9c12992763348336dd423.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b43b6289d6e9c12992763348336dd423.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sixth Force is built around doing things together. You are constantly moving in sync and passing actions back and forth in relay-style co-op. One player can help, rescue, support, or open the next move for the other instead of simply taking over. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/9f73f3f5eab25204fd979ee49916c78c.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/9f73f3f5eab25204fd979ee49916c78c.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/9f73f3f5eab25204fd979ee49916c78c.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for shared fun, not shared blame</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of co-op games stop being fun when one player starts feeling left behind. Sixth Force is designed to feel better than that. If one of you is more experienced and the other is less confident, the game should still feel good for both players. Stronger players can naturally switch between leading and supporting, and the game is built around shared challenges, shared saves, and helping each other through the messy parts. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/f24f3d6d627fffd319426147feca0a04.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/f24f3d6d627fffd319426147feca0a04.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/f24f3d6d627fffd319426147feca0a04.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A sweet world full of cozy chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sixth Force takes you to a surreal candyland full of strange hazards, ridiculous enemies, weird helpers, and playful disaster. The deeper you go, the harder the candy, and the more this sweet world starts to feel like it is hiding something behind the glaze.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/3114bcec49b3d447596664274a3e1c0e.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/3114bcec49b3d447596664274a3e1c0e.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/3114bcec49b3d447596664274a3e1c0e.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sixth Force does not support single-player mode. The game is designed exclusively for two-player co-op, either locally or online via Steam Remote Play Together. Bring your Player 2.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/42a3d76063e168c50114b27d4d35f915.poster.avif?t=1785783392\" width=1170 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/42a3d76063e168c50114b27d4d35f915.webm?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/42a3d76063e168c50114b27d4d35f915.mp4?t=1785783392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow Sixth Force to get updates on the next chapter after the free prologue.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the Sixth Force in a <strong>comedy co-op adventure for 2 players</strong> where connection becomes a superpower. You and your partner are linked by a  <strong>bond</strong> that keeps you close and powers your <strong>energy whips</strong>. The same force that binds you also gives you power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, it is all sugar, giggles, and cozy chaos. But beneath the frosting, something stranger is waitin